# NCZ-OS "Screensaver & Lock" settings/chooser window.
#
# Desktop entry: launcher/dev.ncz.screensaver.desktop
# Application id: dev.ncz.screensaver
# GSettings schema: dev.ncz.screensaver (config/dev.ncz.screensaver.gschema.xml)
#
# GTK 4 + libadwaita via python3-gi. Edits the same GSettings schema the
# Singularity "screensaver-chooser" plugin already uses, so the two stay
# in sync. Catalog from $NCZ_SCREENSAVER_CATALOG or one of the standard
# TSV paths; installed-binary lookup from $NCZ_SCREENSAVER_DIRS or the
# standard search dirs.
#
# Testing hooks:
#   --dump       : JSON dump of live settings + catalog, no window, no display.
#   --self-test  : Drive the live UI, assert GSettings, exit 0/1/2.
#
# Environment overrides follow docs/LAUNCHER-DESIGN.md sec. 3.

